      "body": "PageTemplatify 是简单灵活的静态 HTML 页面生成工具，基于 JSON 配置和 Jinja2 模板引擎。内置多套模板，无需编程知识，快速生成专业页面并部署上线，可用于网站测试或快速展示。\n\n- 项目仓库：https://github.com/GeekAtTeam/PageTemplatify\n- 在线示例：https://geekatteam.github.io/PageTemplatify/\n\n部分截图：\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c58c4fd1-a23d-4c86-9878-5c809353687c)\n\nSaaS 网页模板：\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7c7840bd-ff9c-4e7c-9f9b-adcfbb2a8ad8)\n\n新闻 CMS 网页模板：\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad64930a-8a5c-45ee-aadf-0204471225ff)\n\n电商平台网页模板：\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d2f221fc-b282-4365-aad3-b87865c21f67)",
